---
import '../styles/global.css';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description?: string;
  current?: 'writing' | 'projects' | 'about' | 'subscribe' | 'home';
  masthead?: 'full' | 'compact';
}

const {
  title,
  description = '林晚舟的个人写作刊物：工程笔记、数字生活与徒步手记。',
  current = 'home',
  masthead = 'compact'
} = Astro.props;

const nav = [
  { href: '/writing/', key: 'writing', label: '文章' },
  { href: '/projects/', key: 'projects', label: '专题' },
  { href: '/about/', key: 'about', label: '关于' },
  { href: '/subscribe/', key: 'subscribe', label: '订阅' }
];
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{title} · 晚舟手记</title>
  <meta name="description" content={description}>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="晚舟手记 RSS" href="/rss.xml">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,560;9..144,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  {masthead === 'full' ? (
    <header class="masthead wrap rise">
      <p class="masthead-over">
        <span>个人写作刊物</span>
        <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>创立于 2023</span>
        <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>第 47 期 · 2026 年 8 月</span>
      </p>
      <h1 class="masthead-title">
        晚舟手记
        <span class="seal" aria-hidden="true">晚舟</span>
        <span class="latin">Wanzhou&rsquo;s Journal</span>
      </h1>
      <hr class="rule-double">
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="主导航">
        {nav.map(item => (
          <a href={item.href} aria-current={current === item.key ? 'page' : undefined}>{item.label}</a>
        ))}
      </nav>
    </header>
  ) : (
    <header class="masthead-compact wrap rise">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        晚舟手记
        <span class="seal" aria-hidden="true">晚舟</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="主导航">
        {nav.map(item => (
          <a href={item.href} aria-current={current === item.key ? 'page' : undefined}>{item.label}</a>
        ))}
      </nav>
    </header>
  )}

  <main>
    <slot />
  </main>

  <footer class="colophon">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <span class="c-brand">晚舟手记<span class="seal" aria-hidden="true">晚舟</span></span>
        <p>一本用纸面规矩办的网络刊物：工程笔记、数字生活、徒步手记。更新不快，每篇都写过三遍。</p>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="页脚导航">
        {nav.map(item => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
        <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="fineprint">
        <span>本刊无广告，用纸是像素的，印厂是浏览器。</span>
        <span class="latin">Est. 2023 · No. 47 · Set in Fraunces &amp; Songti</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
